1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 23=

8
00:00:46,859 --> 00:00:47,979
I do not approve

9
00:00:48,619 --> 00:00:49,859
this marriage.

10
00:00:56,539 --> 00:00:57,539
What puny insect,

11
00:00:57,579 --> 00:00:58,659
too ignorant of its place,

12
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:00,240
dares to disturb my wedding?

13
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,679
Are you Zhao Dong, the one
who beguiled my daughter?

14
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,159
What an ignorant insect!

15
00:01:06,379 --> 00:01:07,840
I haven't looked for you,

16
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:10,540
yet you come knocking to seek death.

17
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:11,540
Silence.

18
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:25,099
If not for the blood
you share with my little maid,

19
00:01:25,359 --> 00:01:28,560
those three strikes would banish you
to the realm of beasts,

20
00:01:28,859 --> 00:01:30,040
trapped in endless cycles.

21
00:01:31,459 --> 00:01:34,239
Junior, what ruthless methods!

22
00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:36,200
Lingfeng is only Body Integration.

23
00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:38,260
And you are at best
an early-stage Mahayana.

24
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,260
I am at the peak of Mahayana,

25
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,760
the mortal realm's top.

26
00:01:43,439 --> 00:01:44,439
Lord True Immortal,

27
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,439
please allow me

28
00:01:45,620 --> 00:01:48,239
to slaughter this villain
and his accomplices

29
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:49,719
to assert your might!

30
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,560
Hold on.

31
00:01:53,540 --> 00:01:54,540
Listen, insects.

32
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,959
I shall grant you an immense blessing.

33
00:01:57,540 --> 00:01:59,959
If you kneel,
acknowledge me as your master,

34
00:02:00,159 --> 00:02:01,159
and serve as my slaves,

35
00:02:01,299 --> 00:02:03,159
I will spare your lives

36
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:06,060
and grant you a path to immortality.

37
00:02:06,099 --> 00:02:08,639
Bah! True Immortal, my foot!

38
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,560
With filthy thoughts like yours,

39
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:13,080
you're lower than the bugs
in my village ditch!

40
00:02:13,419 --> 00:02:15,379
How dare you covet my sisters-in-law?

41
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,340
You'll have to keep dreaming!

42
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:20,520
Insulting a True Immortal means death!

43
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,960
S-Sister-in-law, it's me.

44
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,520
I-I'm Ergou.

45
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,560
I don't care who you are.

46
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:38,159
Insulting a True Immortal

47
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,240
is an unforgivable crime!

48
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,000
Little maid,

49
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,759
you've gotten naughty.

50
00:02:43,219 --> 00:02:45,960
Looks like a spanking awaits you
when we get home.

51
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:51,759
Now is the time for you to wake up.

52
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,919
Master? I'm sorry, Master.

53
00:03:01,919 --> 00:03:03,139
I know my fault.

54
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,580
I will atone with my life.

55
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:07,340
Holy Maiden!

56
00:03:07,740 --> 00:03:08,740
Have you lost your mind?

57
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:10,960
How could you kneel
before such an insect?

58
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:14,240
What's left of our sect's dignity
now that you've knelt?

59
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:16,300
What's become
of Lord True Immortal's pride?

60
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:20,419
You are plunging our Zixia Sect
into total ruin!

61
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:23,620
Rise.

62
00:03:26,659 --> 00:03:27,800
Please calm your anger.

63
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:30,740
The Holy Maiden
must be beguiled by sorcery.

64
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,780
What sect?

65
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,060
It's nothing but a filthy cesspool

66
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:36,280
driven by greed.

67
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,360
What Peerless True Immortal?

68
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,060
Just a lustful hypocrite

69
00:03:40,060 --> 00:03:41,199
who bullies the weak.

70
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,919
I see only my master.

71
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:47,080
My life belongs to him.

72
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:50,319
Well. Very well.

73
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:53,280
Ancestor Zixia, kill them.

74
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,280
Spare no one!

75
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,120
As you command.

76
00:04:00,439 --> 00:04:01,699
If you want to touch my master,

77
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,719
you'll have to step over my corpse!

78
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,860
A mere Nascent Soul stage?

79
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:09,000
You are nothing but an ant before me.

80
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:12,560
Holy Maiden, if you repent now,

81
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
kneel, and beg for mercy,

82
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,699
your life may yet be spared.

83
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,160
I'd rather die!

84
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:21,180
You're a brave girl.

85
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,699
But the humiliation, injustice,

86
00:04:23,939 --> 00:04:25,600
and coercion you suffered today

87
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,399
should not be avenged by me.

88
00:04:28,279 --> 00:04:29,319
You shall wield

89
00:04:29,959 --> 00:04:31,240
the sword in your hand

90
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,439
and settle every score yourself.

91
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,040
I want you to use this blade

92
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:38,399
to cut down this so-called
mortal realm's top ancestor

93
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,019
and that aloft Peerless True Immortal

94
00:04:42,019 --> 00:04:43,160
once and for all.

95
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,500
A mere Nascent Soul stage

96
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,920
wants to slay a Mahayana

97
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:49,459
and a True Immortal?

98
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:52,639
Has this insect lost his mind?

99
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,560
Everyone, did you hear that?

100
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:58,160
Little maid.

101
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,240
With an immortal's touch,

102
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:09,620
you're granted eternal life.

103
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,360
Today, I make you a Golden Immortal.

104
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,800
Laws as the foundation,

105
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,540
forging your Dao Fruit.

106
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,319
Shatter barriers.

107
00:05:18,819 --> 00:05:19,819
Clarify the heart.

108
00:05:24,220 --> 00:05:25,220
Reveal true nature!

109
00:05:33,060 --> 00:05:34,060
Divine Transformation?

110
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:35,420
Void Refinement?

111
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:36,540
Body Integration?

112
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,920
Mahayana?

113
00:05:38,079 --> 00:05:39,079
True Immortal?

114
00:05:40,180 --> 00:05:43,139
No, she's still improving.

115
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,779
How is this possible?

116
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Today, I become a Golden Immortal.

117
00:05:58,220 --> 00:05:59,420
With a single thought,

118
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,420
he created a supreme Golden Immortal.

119
00:06:01,819 --> 00:06:03,920
What terrifying power is this?

120
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,720
Wh-Who on earth are you?

121
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,500
Th-This is impossible.

122
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:10,240
The lower realm's laws are flawed,

123
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,240
with scarce resources.

124
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:13,279
How could you forge
a Golden Immortal so fast?

125
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:14,639
Who are you really?

126
00:06:15,699 --> 00:06:18,379
That's Dong.
That's our invincible husband.

127
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,699
Thank you, Master, for my rebirth.

128
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,860
I shall be your blade in this life,

129
00:06:25,939 --> 00:06:27,339
clearing all obstacles for you.

130
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:28,980
I will give my life

131
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,100
and never fail you.

132
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:31,839
Rise.

133
00:06:32,839 --> 00:06:34,399
Go reclaim your lost dignity.

134
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:37,579
Show the world with your blade

135
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,660
the price of crossing you.

136
00:06:43,019 --> 00:06:45,439
So what if you've become
a Golden Immortal?

137
00:06:45,660 --> 00:06:49,480
Lord True Immortal's master
is a being of Supreme Eternity.

138
00:06:49,779 --> 00:06:51,360
Before such a being,

139
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:54,620
you are still nothing but an insect.

140
00:07:03,980 --> 00:07:05,720
- Ancestor!
- Ancestor!

141
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,720
This is impossible!

142
00:07:14,339 --> 00:07:17,000
You're next.

143
00:07:19,319 --> 00:07:20,779
A Golden Immortal is impressive?

144
00:07:22,699 --> 00:07:23,899
I summon the will of my master,

145
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:26,939
Divine Venerable
of Supreme Eternity, to descend!

146
00:07:48,420 --> 00:07:50,220
This is the power
of my master's mere will.

147
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:52,680
Though only a wisp,

148
00:07:52,860 --> 00:07:54,920
it's enough to elevate me
to peak Golden Immortal.

149
00:07:55,980 --> 00:07:56,980
Insects,

150
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:59,620
prepare to face the wrath
of the Supreme Eternity!

151
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:21,220
A mere early Golden Immortal
dares oppose me?

152
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,959
Foolish!

153
00:08:23,819 --> 00:08:25,819
That is not how you wield a sword.

154
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:29,000
A sword wielder never yields,

155
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:30,319
charging straight ahead,

156
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:33,480
with only the resolve
to cut through everything.

157
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:41,720
Focus your mind.

158
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,080
Calm your breath.

159
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,919
Feel the sword's pulse.

160
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:49,679
Sense the path of the laws.

161
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,700
Channel all your awareness,

162
00:08:53,419 --> 00:08:54,879
all your strength,

163
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:57,419
and all your defiance

164
00:08:58,139 --> 00:08:59,440
into a single strike.

165
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,279
Then slash.

166
00:09:06,539 --> 00:09:10,000
Heaven-Splitting Slash!

167
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:11,919
Heavenly Annihilating Thunder,

168
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:12,960
block it for me!

169
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:37,559
What realm are you exactly in now?

170
00:09:39,299 --> 00:09:40,299
Not Dao Ancestor.

171
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:41,740
Not Supreme Eternity.

172
00:09:42,799 --> 00:09:43,879
So unfathomable.

173
00:09:45,919 --> 00:09:48,460
Wherever I am, there is eternity.

174
00:09:49,399 --> 00:09:52,000
Only you cherish that worthless throne.

175
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:54,480
Past grudges and grievances

176
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,220
are all dust in the wind.

177
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,440
Cross me again,

178
00:09:59,259 --> 00:10:00,340
and I will destroy you.

179
00:10:02,659 --> 00:10:04,059
Though I betrayed you,

180
00:10:05,279 --> 00:10:08,139
only you are worthy of me in this world.

181
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:12,779
How could I ever let you go?

182
00:10:12,779 --> 00:10:15,835
(Affection)

183
00:10:32,041 --> 00:10:35,632
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

184
00:10:35,632 --> 00:10:38,419
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

185
00:10:38,995 --> 00:10:41,157
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

186
00:10:41,157 --> 00:10:44,003
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

187
00:10:44,003 --> 00:10:47,281
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

188
00:10:47,281 --> 00:10:48,915
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

189
00:10:48,915 --> 00:10:50,979
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

190
00:10:50,979 --> 00:10:52,515
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

191
00:10:52,515 --> 00:10:55,297
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

192
00:10:55,746 --> 00:10:57,651
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

193
00:10:57,651 --> 00:11:03,682
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

194
00:11:04,264 --> 00:11:08,147
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

195
00:11:08,147 --> 00:11:11,372
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

196
00:11:11,884 --> 00:11:14,483
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

197
00:11:14,483 --> 00:11:19,611
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

198
00:11:19,611 --> 00:11:23,139
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

199
00:11:23,139 --> 00:11:26,847
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

200
00:11:26,847 --> 00:11:28,739
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

201
00:11:28,739 --> 00:11:30,816
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

202
00:11:30,816 --> 00:11:33,347
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

203
00:11:33,347 --> 00:11:37,384
♪You met the most precious person♪

204
00:11:39,052 --> 00:11:40,915
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

205
00:11:40,915 --> 00:11:43,434
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

206
00:11:43,434 --> 00:11:44,883
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

207
00:11:44,883 --> 00:11:47,185
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

208
00:11:47,185 --> 00:11:49,155
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

209
00:11:49,155 --> 00:11:53,565
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

210
00:11:53,565 --> 00:11:55,107
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

211
00:11:55,107 --> 00:11:57,017
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

212
00:11:57,017 --> 00:12:00,291
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

213
00:12:00,291 --> 00:12:03,612
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

214
00:12:03,612 --> 00:12:05,347
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

215
00:12:05,347 --> 00:12:09,971
♪Just catch your breath first♪

216
00:12:09,971 --> 00:12:13,721
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

217
00:12:13,721 --> 00:12:17,099
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

218
00:12:17,473 --> 00:12:19,443
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

219
00:12:19,443 --> 00:12:25,190
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

220
00:12:25,190 --> 00:12:28,706
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

221
00:12:28,706 --> 00:12:30,275
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

222
00:12:30,275 --> 00:12:32,585
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

223
00:12:32,585 --> 00:12:34,323
♪From laughter to devotion♪

224
00:12:34,323 --> 00:12:36,379
♪From falling to innocence♪

225
00:12:36,379 --> 00:12:38,227
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

226
00:12:38,227 --> 00:12:44,897
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
